{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "label": "Test Frame 00901 - Gas Camera Overhead View of Mature Broilers", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Colour still from channel 1080P-IPC-Gas timestamped 2022-03-14 22:24:52. A near top-down view of large, nearly market-weight white broilers filling the whole frame, with a single grey feed pipe and four red-topped pan feeders across the middle. Birds appear much larger in pixels than in the other channels because the camera is closer to the floor and the animals are older."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_camera_1080p_ipc_gas", "label": "Camera Channel 1080P-IPC-Gas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Third named CCTV channel in the test set. Its mounting is lower or more vertical than the Siren and PIR cameras, producing the largest apparent bird size and the least perspective foreshortening of the three."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_mature_broiler_growth_stage", "label": "Mature Broiler Growth Stage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Birds here have broad bodies, visible red combs and fully feathered white plumage, versus the small fluffy chicks in the February Siren frames. Body size relative to the fixed feeder pans is the visual proxy for flock age, and it changes the target object scale the detector must cover by roughly a factor of three."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_overhead_top_down_viewpoint", "label": "Near Top-Down Overhead Viewpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Gas frames look almost straight down, so birds appear as rotation-symmetric ovals with arbitrary heading and no consistent up direction. Axis-aligned bounding boxes are a poor fit for such arbitrarily oriented elongated bodies, and rotation augmentation matters far more here than in the oblique Siren view."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_occlusion_and_overlap_challenge", "label": "Occlusion and Body-Overlap Detection Challenge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adjacent mature birds overlap so heavily that only partial bodies are visible and boundaries between white plumage regions are nearly invisible. This is the dominant failure mode the test set is built to expose: uniform-coloured, mutually occluding, deformable instances of the same class packed edge to edge."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_broiler_age_progression", "label": "Broiler Age Progression Across the Recording Period", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The burned-in dates span 2022-02-22 to 2022-03-14, about three weeks, over which bird body size grows dramatically while the fixed house furniture stays identical. The test set therefore samples a whole grow-out cycle, so evaluation implicitly measures robustness to subject scale drift over time, not just per-image accuracy."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_camera_1080p_ipc_gas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_mature_broiler_growth_stage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_overhead_top_down_viewpoint", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_occlusion_and_overlap_challenge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_broiler_age_progression", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_red_pan_feeder", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_mature_broiler_growth_stage", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_occlusion_and_overlap_challenge", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_broiler_age_progression", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_broiler_age_progression", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_timestamp_overlay_metadata", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901_overhead_top_down_viewpoint", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_fisheye_lens_distortion", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00901", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_multi_camera_test_dataset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00901.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}